fix(p01): validate each vendor compiler record before launch

Share strict operand-aware compiler validation between preparation and XRT execution. Reject shell expansion, non-LF record boundaries, opaque transports and incorrect kernel ISA/ABI; require every compiler record to establish the frozen configuration and the linker to select the generated runtime. Retain all new helper dependencies in run evidence. Add actual compiler and generated-Make oracles, file-backed negative cases, orchestration guards and snapshot drift checks. Preserve historical packet parsing and accepted GPU evidence; vendor hw_emu remains blocked.
